{"title": "Sun Sickness", "pageid": 4364, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sun_Sickness", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp, /w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sun Sickness</b> is a passive feature available to certain myconid creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While in sunlight, has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Myconid\" title=\"Dead Myconid\">Dead Myconid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Myconid_Sprout\" title=\"Dead Myconid Sprout\">Dead Myconid Sprout</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar_Spore_Servant_(guard_caster)\" title=\"Duergar Spore Servant (guard caster)\">Duergar Spore Servant (guard caster)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar_Spore_Servant_(guard_melee)\" title=\"Duergar Spore Servant (guard melee)\">Duergar Spore Servant (guard melee)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar_Spore_Servant_(patrol_melee)\" title=\"Duergar Spore Servant (patrol melee)\">Duergar Spore Servant (patrol melee)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar_Spore_Servant_(ranged)\" title=\"Duergar Spore Servant (ranged)\">Duergar Spore Servant (ranged)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Glut</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mossy_Myconid\" title=\"Mossy Myconid\">Mossy Myconid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Myconid\" title=\"Noxious Myconid\">Noxious Myconid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Restless_Myconid\" title=\"Restless Myconid\">Restless Myconid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Spaw</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714225316\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 612/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2714/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1407/4194304 bytes\nHighest expa